---
manual: events.click
lines: [2187, 2193]
testability: interactive
display: native
----------- app code
$clicks = []
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 300 do
  stack width: 200, height: 100 do
    click { |button, left, top| $clicks << [button, left, top] }
  end
end
----------- test code
click_at 300, 200
assert_empty $clicks, "a click outside the slot does not reach its block"

click_at 50, 40
assert_equal [[1, 50, 40]], $clicks, "one call with the left button's number and where the click happened"
